  - All code MUST follow PEP 8 style guide
  - Every public function and class MUST include Google-style docstrings covering: function/class purpose, Args (parameter types and meanings), Returns (return value semantics), Raises (possible exceptions)
  - All functions and methods MUST use type hints (PEP 484+)
  - Use Pydantic models for data validation and serialization
  - Async functions MUST use async/await syntax
  - Public functions and classes without docstrings MUST NOT be committed
